Comment: 0,0:22:18.66,0:22:21.39,OP,,0,0,0,kara,Every day's unique, you get one chance at it
Comment: 0,0:22:21.39,0:22:23.45,OP,,0,0,0,kara,So you'd better make it count
Comment: 0,0:22:23.70,0:22:26.38,OP,,0,0,0,kara,When people flaunt morality
Comment: 0,0:22:26.62,0:22:30.09,OP,,0,0,0,kara,You've gotta beware they've got their own agenda
Comment: 0,0:22:30.23,0:22:33.03,OP,,0,0,0,kara,Somewhere in your head, there's a voice that's messin' with ya
Comment: 0,0:22:33.14,0:22:35.03,OP,,0,0,0,kara,Don't ever let it turn you 'round
Comment: 0,0:22:35.28,0:22:38.72,OP,,0,0,0,kara,It can't even blow all that hot air it's full of
Comment: 0,0:22:38.92,0:22:41.66,OP,,0,0,0,kara,Get yourself in gear and live however you wanna
Comment: 0,0:22:41.80,0:22:46.70,OP,,0,0,0,kara,Live so fast that the claws of despair will languish in your dust
Comment: 0,0:22:46.86,0:22:50.72,OP,,0,0,0,kara,And you'll be the one with an agenda that they'll all see as just
Comment: 0,0:22:52.74,0:22:55.54,OP,chors,0,0,0,kara,Keep on shouldering the world around you
Comment: 0,0:22:55.55,0:22:58.28,OP,chors,0,0,0,kara,Keep on doubting every thought that's bound you
Comment: 0,0:22:58.42,0:23:03.06,OP,chors,0,0,0,kara,If things go awry, keep pushing through and know that everything'll work in the end
Comment: 0,0:23:04.40,0:23:07.10,OP,chors,0,0,0,kara,If you find it's in your power to change the world
Comment: 0,0:23:07.15,0:23:09.78,OP,chors,0,0,0,kara,I'm sure you can make the future bright
Comment: 0,0:23:10.02,0:23:13.96,OP,chors,0,0,0,kara,We'll blaze on ahead until we track down the route we want to take
Comment: 0,0:23:15.94,0:23:19.63,OP,,0,0,0,kara,We'll keep trying every door until we find one that goes our way
Dialogue: 10,0:00:01.53,0:00:06.62,Main,,0,0,0,,There's an otome game called {\i1}Our Ray of Light,{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:06.62,0:00:08.49,Main,,0,0,0,,also known as ORL.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:09.18,0:00:15.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Playing that game\Nwas a guilty pleasure in my former life.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:18.37,0:00:21.50,Main,,0,0,0,,I met an abrupt end at the age of 18.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:22.09,0:00:24.46,Main,,0,0,0,,But then, the memories of that past life
Dialogue: 10,0:00:24.96,0:00:28.93,Main,,0,0,0,,came rushing back to me in the world of ORL.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:31.97,0:00:37.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Now I live as Pride Royal Ivy,\N first-born princess of the Kingdom of Freesia.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:38.76,0:00:41.73,Main,,0,0,0,,I am the elder sister of the game's protagonist, Tiara.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:41.73,0:00:45.32,Main,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&\t(20,229,1,\3c&H000000&\4c&H000000&)}And to her love interests, I am...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:45.98,0:00:47.76,Main,,0,0,0,,a source of tragedy,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:48.37,0:00:51.83,Main,,0,0,0,,the most heretical final boss.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:01.36,0:01:02.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Pride?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:03.58,0:01:05.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:05.76,0:01:07.92,Main,,0,0,0,,If anything's the matter, please let me know.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:08.28,0:01:10.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Stale.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:10.24,0:01:13.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Elder Sister, I can't wait until tomorrow!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:13.13,0:01:14.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Neither can I, Tiara.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:14.87,0:01:17.68,Main,,0,0,0,,But... I remain a bit nervous.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:17.92,0:01:21.72,Main,,0,0,0,,I shall do my best to ensure\N that your birthday celebration
Dialogue: 10,0:01:21.72,0:01:24.94,Main,,0,0,0,,proceeds without the faintest of issues.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:25.31,0:01:28.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Chancellor Gilbert.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:28.75,0:01:32.65,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Right, tomorrow is my sixteenth birthday celebration.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:33.06,0:01:37.71,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}In this country, women are considered adults\Nfrom the age of sixteen.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:38.42,0:01:42.57,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's why tomorrow's celebration is a very special day.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:43.14,0:01:48.09,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I don't prove I have what it takes to be queen,\Nor if even the slightest problem occurs,
Dialogue: 10,0:01:48.69,0:01:51.28,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll have more than just bad rumors to contend with.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:51.28,0:01:52.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Rest assured.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:52.69,0:01:55.88,Main,,0,0,0,,When you announce your school system plan,
Dialogue: 10,0:01:55.88,0:01:58.35,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll be right there beside you.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:58.70,0:01:59.83,Main,,0,0,0,,And also...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:05.38,0:02:09.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Actually, I'll save that subject for another time.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:09.92,0:02:12.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, if you'll please excuse me.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:19.18,0:02:20.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Stale.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:21.43,0:02:22.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:22.86,0:02:24.31,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:24.31,0:02:26.47,Main,,0,0,0,,I was just thinking about something.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:26.74,0:02:27.75,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:28.52,0:02:33.07,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Maybe Stale is nervous about tomorrow's festivities, too?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:33.75,0:02:37.63,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I suppose that's because I'm not the most reliable...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:40.97,0:02:44.83,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}As the first-born princess and heir to the throne,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:44.83,0:02:47.19,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and as a sister to these two precious souls,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:47.19,0:02:49.55,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I must avoid making a disgrace of myself tomorrow!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:54.36,0:02:57.16,Main,,0,0,0,,You're way less into this than usual, Stale!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:58.23,0:02:59.04,Main,,0,0,0,,I know...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:00.70,0:03:01.90,Main,,0,0,0,,How many times...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:02.49,0:03:04.45,Main,,0,0,0,,do I have to tell you?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:06.51,0:03:08.96,Main,,0,0,0,,If you've got something to say, then spit it out!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:09.85,0:03:12.72,Main,,0,0,0,,You've been off your game all the time lately!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:16.01,0:03:19.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow is my elder sister's birthday celebration.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:19.85,0:03:20.93,Main,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:20.93,0:03:23.37,Main,,0,0,0,,I've been appointed as a guard for the event.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:27.38,0:03:30.44,Main,,0,0,0,,She's turning sixteen tomorrow.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:30.44,0:03:35.75,Main,,0,0,0,,And her fiancé will be announced at the celebration, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:36.13,0:03:39.25,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid she's forgotten about that.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:40.56,0:03:44.45,Main,,0,0,0,,That's how seriously she's been working on the school system.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:45.18,0:03:49.46,Main,,0,0,0,,No one wants to distract her from that,\Nso they haven't brought it up.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:51.34,0:03:52.29,Main,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:00.01,0:04:01.97,Main,,0,0,0,,You knew this would happen, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:06.84,0:04:08.12,Main,,0,0,0,,I did.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:08.12,0:04:10.02,Main,,0,0,0,,I've made my peace with it.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:10.37,0:04:14.60,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm prepared to devote my heart and soul, and serve as seneschal,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:14.60,0:04:18.16,Main,,0,0,0,,to both my elder sister and her fiancé.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:19.46,0:04:20.81,Main,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:22.04,0:04:26.33,Main,,0,0,0,,that's only if I believe Pride's fiancé\N is someone worthy of her.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:29.92,0:04:31.66,Main,,0,0,0,,I needed to know,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:31.66,0:04:35.49,Main,,0,0,0,,so I did some digging into Pride's fiancé, personally.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:36.36,0:04:42.82,Main,,0,0,0,,He's the extremely outstanding and distinguished\Nfirst-born prince of our allied nation,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:42.82,0:04:44.25,Main,,0,0,0,,the Kingdom of Anemone.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:44.73,0:04:46.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, doesn't that sound ideal?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:47.46,0:04:48.31,Main,,0,0,0,,It does.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:48.77,0:04:49.91,Main,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:49.91,0:04:52.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Rumor has it that he's also a womanizer and a flirt.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:53.65,0:04:55.99,Main,,0,0,0,,To an extreme degree!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:56.96,0:04:59.85,Main,,0,0,0,,First-born prince Leon Adonis Coronaria.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:00.35,0:05:03.28,Main,,0,0,0,,The Kingdom of Anemone's most notorious playboy!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:03.91,0:05:06.35,Main,,0,0,0,,That's who she's getting engaged to!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:12.74,0:05:13.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Elder Sister.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:14.56,0:05:21.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Your announcements of the alliance policy\N and the school system went wonderfully.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:21.72,0:05:22.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:23.93,0:05:26.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Not to mention, that dress looks lovely on you!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:26.88,0:05:28.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Doesn't it, Stale?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:28.36,0:05:30.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Uh, yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:30.96,0:05:33.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Although, showing less skin might be prudent...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:35.76,0:05:42.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Your Royal Highness Princess Pride,\N I wish you the most joyous of birthdays.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:42.68,0:05:44.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Commander Roderick!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:44.94,0:05:49.25,Main,,0,0,0,,You have truly become an admirable princess.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:49.98,0:05:51.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:54.53,0:05:58.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Happy birthday to you, Princess Pride.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:58.72,0:06:02.88,Main,,0,0,0,,We are blessed that you were born into our kingdom.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:03.34,0:06:06.83,Main,,0,0,0,,L-Lieutenant Commander Clark!{technically a naval-ish rank but eh I think it works}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:07.35,0:06:11.61,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}These two aren't supposed to be love interests, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:12.60,0:06:13.35,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wait.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:13.83,0:06:15.83,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That reminds me...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:17.48,0:06:20.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Happy birthday.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:20.56,0:06:22.65,Main,,0,0,0,,I am Callum Bordeaux.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:22.65,0:06:25.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Captain Callum.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:25.68,0:06:27.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Your reputation precedes you.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:30.81,0:06:31.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Princess Pride,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:32.34,0:06:35.11,Main,,0,0,0,,I wish you a happy birthday.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:35.98,0:06:38.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Your dress is very pretty.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:40.08,0:06:42.71,Main,,0,0,0,,I mean, not just the dress,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:42.71,0:06:44.49,Main,,0,0,0,,but you are as well.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:45.31,0:06:47.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Arthur.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:47.22,0:06:49.18,Main,,0,0,0,,I look forward to your continued service.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:53.36,0:06:54.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:55.06,0:06:56.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:57.37,0:06:58.87,Main,,0,0,0,,I will protect you always.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:14.77,0:07:15.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Elder Sister!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:16.83,0:07:19.31,Main,,0,0,0,,I-It's nothing, I'm all right.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:20.23,0:07:23.69,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I suddenly remembered two of the game's love interests!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:25.53,0:07:31.10,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wait, if I'm turning sixteen today, that means...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:31.79,0:07:33.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you quite well?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:34.83,0:07:36.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Your Royal Highness, Princess Pride.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:42.53,0:07:45.85,Main,,0,0,0,,I deeply apologize for not coming\N to pay my respects sooner.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:46.72,0:07:53.16,Main,,0,0,0,,I am Leon Adonis Coronaria,\N first-born prince of the Kingdom of Anemone.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:53.59,0:07:55.93,Main,,0,0,0,,I appreciate your kindness.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:57.63,0:08:01.04,Main,,0,0,0,,I am the first-born princess, Pride Royal Ivy.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:01.38,0:08:03.80,Main,,0,0,0,,It is an honor and a pleasure to meet you.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:04.35,0:08:05.46,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh my god.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:05.46,0:08:09.97,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't believe I forgot that\N I get engaged on my sixteenth birthday!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:12.02,0:08:12.89,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Leon.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:13.20,0:08:18.33,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A love interest in the first installment\Nof the ORL series, and Queen Pride's—
Dialogue: 10,0:08:18.33,0:08:20.80,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}—that's to say, {\i0}my{\i1} fiancé.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:20.80,0:08:27.61,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ultimately, he loses everything\N and has his heart broken at Pride's hands.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:38.79,0:08:43.29,Main,,0,0,0,,I have never laid my eyes upon someone as beautiful as you.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:43.70,0:08:48.59,Main,,0,0,0,,I do hope our acquaintance will be a long one.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:48.93,0:08:50.77,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wait, wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:50.77,0:08:53.60,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mother hasn't announced anything yet!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:53.95,0:08:55.00,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What do I do?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:55.00,0:08:58.34,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's acting so different from\N how he does at the start of the game!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:58.34,0:09:00.27,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}My heart's not ready for this...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:01.84,0:09:04.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Please, call me Leon.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:04.46,0:09:07.91,Main,,0,0,0,,In that case, you may call me Pride.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:10.95,0:09:13.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Shall we head back?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:14.31,0:09:16.58,Main,,0,0,0,,It seems something is about to happen.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:16.58,0:09:18.57,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Something"?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:18.57,0:09:22.08,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, come on! He knows {\i0}exactly{\i1}\Nwhat's going to happen!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:23.65,0:09:31.59,Main,,0,0,0,,I would like to introduce first-born princess\NPride Royal Ivy's betrothed.{@ED mayhaps “introduce the betrothed / of my first-born daughter, Pride Royal Ivy” -p}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:32.44,0:09:37.11,Main,,0,0,0,,The first-born prince of the Kingdom of Anemone,\NLeon Adonis Coronaria.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:37.60,0:09:42.35,Main,,0,0,0,,By his engagement to my beloved daughter Pride,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:42.35,0:09:46.65,Main,,0,0,0,,we shall further strengthen our alliance.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:48.14,0:09:49.39,Main,,0,0,0,,It is an honor.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:52.56,0:09:54.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Princess Pride,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:55.54,0:09:58.15,Main,,0,0,0,,I shall love you with all of my heart.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:01.45,0:10:05.71,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And with that, my birthday festivities\N came to an end without incident.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:09.21,0:10:13.71,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Leon will spend the next three days \Nat the castle, then return home.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:14.77,0:10:20.67,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A week after that, he will come\Nto fully live in our castle as my fiancé.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:22.65,0:10:25.47,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The next ten days are very significant.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:26.27,0:10:29.65,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Both for him, and for me.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:33.88,0:10:36.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Stay away, stay away, stay away!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:36.08,0:10:38.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Stay away, leave me alone!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:39.64,0:10:41.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't be like that, Leon.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:42.06,0:10:46.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Your darling, beloved fiancée\Nis here to pay you a visit.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:47.54,0:10:49.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:49.08,0:10:52.24,Main,,0,0,0,,You love me, don't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:53.76,0:10:57.05,Main,,0,0,0,,I love you! I love you! I love you! I love you! I love you!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:57.05,0:10:59.30,Main,,0,0,0,,S-S-So please!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:03.29,0:11:05.62,Main,,0,0,0,,I love you, too, you know?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:05.62,0:11:07.74,Main,,0,0,0,,But it really {\i1}is{\i0} unfortunate.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:07.74,0:11:10.82,Main,,0,0,0,,You and I haven't actually gotten married yet, have we?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:11.56,0:11:15.82,Main,,0,0,0,,You're the prince consort in name alone\N and no one around cares for you a bit.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:16.57,0:11:22.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Say, even the former king of Anemone\Ntold you to never come back, didn't he?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:22.63,0:11:28.83,Main,,0,0,0,,I wonder what will happen to you\N if I choose to break off our engagement, hmm?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:29.16,0:11:30.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, that reminds me!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:30.84,0:11:34.84,Main,,0,0,0,,It seems my little sister has been coming here\Nto spend time with you lately, hmm?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:35.72,0:11:37.34,Main,,0,0,0,,You two sure get along well.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:37.86,0:11:41.68,Main,,0,0,0,,I might have another... jealous fit, you know.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:41.68,0:11:44.05,Main,,0,0,0,,No, I don't feel that way about your sister!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:44.05,0:11:45.73,Main,,0,0,0,,No, no!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:45.73,0:11:47.10,Main,,0,0,0,,I swear, I only love you, Pride!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:47.37,0:11:48.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Just you!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:52.35,0:11:53.77,Main,,0,0,0,,How lovely!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:54.19,0:11:58.61,Main,,0,0,0,,That face you're making... It's my favorite!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:58.93,0:12:00.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't fret.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:00.69,0:12:03.53,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll never let you go.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:04.52,0:12:06.63,Main,,0,0,0,,After all,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:06.63,0:12:09.66,Main,,0,0,0,,you're my cute little toy.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:09.66,0:12:12.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Even if you cheat on me again...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:12.69,0:12:18.13,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll always let {\i1}you alone{\i0} go unpunished.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:18.62,0:12:19.26,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:19.77,0:12:20.89,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No, no...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:21.44,0:12:23.51,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No, no, no...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:26.70,0:12:29.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Pride, how are you feeling?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:29.69,0:12:31.77,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm fine, thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:32.50,0:12:34.91,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Though I slept strangely last night...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:36.12,0:12:38.22,Main,,0,0,0,,And how are you, Prince Leon?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:39.25,0:12:43.87,Main,,0,0,0,,I feel quite blessed to see my beloved Pride\Nstarting so bright and early.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:46.00,0:12:51.51,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Leon is a magnificent prince who has all the skills and temperament needed to become an ideal king.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:52.11,0:12:55.29,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}However, rumors of his philandering have spread far.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:55.84,0:12:59.26,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This caused him to be ostracized from the Kingdom of Anemone
Dialogue: 10,0:12:59.26,0:13:03.61,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and engaged to the atrocious\Nand diabolical Queen Pride.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:04.63,0:13:09.10,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ultimately, he is so badly traumatized by Pride
Dialogue: 10,0:13:09.64,0:13:13.31,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}that he develops a severe and intense fear of people.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:14.71,0:13:19.19,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He loses all status and influence,\N becoming a prince in name only.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:20.79,0:13:26.19,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Understandably, there's absolutely no romance\Nbetween Pride and Leon in the game.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:27.62,0:13:28.75,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yet...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:32.96,0:13:35.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Shall we take a short rest?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:43.15,0:13:47.55,Main,,0,0,0,,I love you, more than anyone and anything.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:47.55,0:13:48.55,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There he goes!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:48.55,0:13:50.60,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The flirt archetype working his magic!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:51.09,0:13:52.44,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I never stood out in my old life,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:52.44,0:13:57.27,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and haven't attracted any romantic interest\Neven after getting reincarnated.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:57.27,0:13:59.19,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is just too much for me!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:00.17,0:14:03.06,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But even so, I have to get a grip.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:03.06,0:14:06.87,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I need to accept his advances and not shy away.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:06.87,0:14:12.86,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have to earn some of his trust before he goes back to his country.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:13.62,0:14:14.72,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:15.15,0:14:17.15,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There's no need for me to swoon.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:17.66,0:14:21.85,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Just forget about being nervous, shy, or anything like that.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:22.61,0:14:24.51,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}After all, the love he murmurs on about...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:25.52,0:14:27.77,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}is all a lie.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:45.57,0:14:46.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Val?!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:49.42,0:14:51.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Sefekh and Khemet are here too!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:53.02,0:14:54.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mistress.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:54.56,0:14:57.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Grew up to be pretty good-looking, eh?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:58.48,0:15:00.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Mistress, you're so cute!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:00.29,0:15:01.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, cute!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:02.04,0:15:04.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, you still haven't really filled out much.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:05.31,0:15:08.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Brought you correspondence from the Lilyturf Kingdom.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:08.55,0:15:12.78,Main,,0,0,0,,And a letter of congratulations on your engagement.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:13.86,0:15:14.89,Main,,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:14.89,0:15:17.14,Main,,0,0,0,,What's your fiancé like?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:17.56,0:15:19.64,Main,,0,0,0,,He's wonderful.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:19.64,0:15:22.32,Main,,0,0,0,,The first-born prince of the Kingdom of Anemone.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:22.56,0:15:24.86,Main,,0,0,0,,He's been very kind to me.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:19.29,0:15:20.78,Alt,,0,0,0,,{\an8}What's that thing?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:20.78,0:15:21.80,Alt,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I dunno.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:21.80,0:15:23.58,Alt,,0,0,0,,{\an8}It's so awesome!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:23.58,0:15:24.48,Alt,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I know!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:28.37,0:15:30.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Feeling like runnin' away with us?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:31.59,0:15:34.86,Main,,0,0,0,,I mean, I {\i1}am{\i0} your servant and all.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:34.86,0:15:40.08,Main,,0,0,0,,I can easily get you outta the kingdom, if that's what you want me to do.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:41.46,0:15:45.85,Main,,0,0,0,,It ain't so bad, living life on the run.\NFree to do whatever you want anywhere in the world.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:46.72,0:15:51.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Using my power to support three kids\N would be easy enough.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:55.74,0:15:56.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Is there something funny?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:56.98,0:15:59.37,Main,,0,0,0,,No, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:59.37,0:16:05.29,Main,,0,0,0,,I just started thinking that living a life\N on the run with all of you would actually be nice.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:06.39,0:16:10.12,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Imagine if the villainous queen just up and vanished,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:10.56,0:16:16.04,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}so Tiara could safely ascend the throne\Nand have her pick of eligible bachelors.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:16.04,0:16:18.72,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Like Arthur, Stale, Prince Leon, or the other suitor.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:18.72,0:16:21.38,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Together, they would lead this kingdom into peace.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:22.99,0:16:26.26,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But I can't take his hand right now.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:26.71,0:16:30.83,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I may be the world's worst queen\N and heretical final boss, but...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:31.51,0:16:36.62,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Even so, I've come to love this nation and its people.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:37.45,0:16:39.77,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll fight my fate for as long as I can.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:40.88,0:16:42.95,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is where I want to be.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:43.60,0:16:46.25,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Royalty to the end.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:47.54,0:16:49.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the offer, Val.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:49.03,0:16:51.01,Main,,0,0,0,,But I'll keep toughing it out.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:51.84,0:16:55.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Although, if I ever truly lose my place here...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:56.75,0:17:00.20,Main,,0,0,0,,I'd be happy if you'd take me in.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:02.68,0:17:04.31,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no "if" about it.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:05.49,0:17:09.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Just order me to take you in, Princess.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:12.71,0:17:13.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Very well, then.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:14.49,0:17:17.39,Main,,0,0,0,,If that time comes, and you agree to it,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:17.92,0:17:20.21,Main,,0,0,0,,please take me away with you.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:24.79,0:17:25.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Time to go!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:28.46,0:17:29.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Val...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:30.98,0:17:32.96,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you're in my life.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:46.78,0:17:50.47,Main,,0,0,0,,If the time comes when you seriously wanna ditch everything,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:51.86,0:17:56.26,Main,,0,0,0,,then I'll spend the rest of my life\Nmaking sure you all can live.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:25.48,0:18:28.46,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm grateful you've taken me on a tour to so many places.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:28.90,0:18:31.97,Main,,0,0,0,,The Kingdom of Freesia is a lovely nation.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:32.34,0:18:33.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:34.28,0:18:41.48,Main,,0,0,0,,I've heard that you take it upon yourself\Nto visit the town around your own castle, Prince Leon.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:41.74,0:18:44.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's important to know how my people live.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:44.35,0:18:48.20,Main,,0,0,0,,And so, I make it a point to\Nvisit and speak with them personally.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:48.20,0:18:54.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Because being in touch with the people is\Nthe most important thing that a leader like me can do.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:57.71,0:18:59.71,Main,,0,0,0,,What an impressive way of thinking.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:14.31,0:19:18.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Pride, would you like to join me\N in gazing up at the starry sky?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:18.94,0:19:20.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:34.95,0:19:36.07,Main,,0,0,0,,That must be...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:38.66,0:19:40.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Arthur.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:40.10,0:19:41.46,Main,,0,0,0,,That you, Stale?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:42.28,0:19:44.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Arthur. Prince Leon is—
Dialogue: 10,0:19:44.29,0:19:45.16,Main,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:46.11,0:19:49.29,Main,,0,0,0,,I hate that Princess Pride is going to marry Prince Leon.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:50.22,0:19:53.76,Main,,0,0,0,,I understand the importance of a royal marriage.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:54.10,0:19:54.79,Main,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:55.57,0:19:57.01,Main,,0,0,0,,That guy is no good.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:57.42,0:20:00.02,Main,,0,0,0,,He can't make the princess happy.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:00.02,0:20:02.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Arthur, listen to me carefully.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:02.71,0:20:05.21,Main,,0,0,0,,My apologies, but I was wrong.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:05.76,0:20:07.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Prince Leon is a good per—
Dialogue: 10,0:20:07.02,0:20:09.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Well...{@ED maybe “I don't care!” -p} I won't accept him!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:10.40,0:20:14.27,Main,,0,0,0,,As it stands, that jerk marrying her is...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:15.40,0:20:16.98,Main,,0,0,0,,unacceptable!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:19.98,0:20:22.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Those creepy smiles...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:23.54,0:20:25.05,Main,,0,0,0,,They give me chills!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:25.91,0:20:27.27,Main,,0,0,0,,{\c&H000000&\t(-19,273,1,\c&HFFFFFF&)}It's unnatural!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:34.63,0:20:38.80,Main,,0,0,0,,You're telling me that\Nboth Elder Sister and Prince Leon{@TLC how does he get that idea from his dialogue though -p}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:38.80,0:20:42.09,Main,,0,0,0,,have been faking their smiles this entire time?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:42.98,0:20:43.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Why, though?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:44.91,0:20:48.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Prince Leon would be one thing,\N but why Elder Sister as well?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:51.40,0:20:54.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Well then, Pride, I will see you again soon.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:54.37,0:20:55.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Prince Leon.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:57.55,0:20:58.57,Main,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:59.74,0:21:01.24,Main,,0,0,0,,The promise we made last night...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:01.62,0:21:03.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Please keep it.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:08.10,0:21:08.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Pride...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:09.22,0:21:11.75,Main,,0,0,0,,What did you promise last night?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:12.98,0:21:18.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, isn't this grand? All three of the royal siblings\Nare here to roll out the welcome mat!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:18.87,0:21:24.05,Main,,0,0,0,,The first princess of Lilyturf Kingdom\N sent quite the gift for your birthday.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:24.05,0:21:25.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Val!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:25.36,0:21:27.57,Main,,0,0,0,,I have a highly-confidential request for you!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:30.89,0:21:33.44,Main,,0,0,0,,What? Why do {\i1}I{\i0} have to?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:33.96,0:21:35.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeesh.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:35.46,0:21:36.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Elder Sister...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:36.15,0:21:37.03,Main,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:38.57,0:21:40.66,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes, everything's fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:41.26,0:21:45.49,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The memories of my past life give me\Nthe insight I need to take action here.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:46.62,0:21:49.06,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I am the only one...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:50.43,0:21:52.20,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}who can bring Prince Leon happiness.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:27.39,0:23:32.39,Main,,0,0,0,,The Most Heretical Last Boss Queen:\N From Villainess to Savior.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:33.35,0:23:37.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Episode 2: "The Cruel Queen Speaks".
Dialogue: 1,0:22:18.51,0:22:21.24,OP,,0,0,0,fx,{\c&HFFFFFF&\fad(150,150)\t(2580,2730,\1a&HFF&)}Every day's unique, you get one chance at it
