Dialogue: 1,0:22:21.24,0:22:23.55,OP,,0,0,0,fx,{\c&HFFFFFF&\fad(150,150)\t(2160,2310,\1a&HFF&)}So you'd better make it count
Dialogue: 2,0:22:21.24,0:22:23.55,OP,,0,0,0,fx,{\bord0\fad(150,150)}So you'd better make it count
Dialogue: 1,0:22:23.55,0:22:26.47,OP,,0,0,0,fx,{\c&HFFFFFF&\fad(150,150)\t(2770,2920,\1a&HFF&)}When people flaunt morality
Dialogue: 2,0:22:23.55,0:22:26.47,OP,,0,0,0,fx,{\bord0\fad(150,150)}When people flaunt morality
Dialogue: 1,0:22:26.47,0:22:30.08,OP,,0,0,0,fx,{\c&HFFFFFF&\fad(150,150)\t(3460,3610,\1a&HFF&)}You've gotta beware they've got their own agenda
Dialogue: 2,0:22:26.47,0:22:30.08,OP,,0,0,0,fx,{\bord0\fad(150,150)}You've gotta beware they've got their own agenda
Dialogue: 1,0:22:30.08,0:22:32.99,OP,,0,0,0,fx,{\c&HFFFFFF&\fad(150,150)\t(2760,2910,\1a&HFF&)}Somewhere in your head, there's a voice that's messin' with ya
Dialogue: 2,0:22:30.08,0:22:32.99,OP,,0,0,0,fx,{\bord0\fad(150,150)}Somewhere in your head, there's a voice that's messin' with ya
Dialogue: 1,0:22:32.99,0:22:35.13,OP,,0,0,0,fx,{\c&HFFFFFF&\fad(150,150)\t(1990,2140,\1a&HFF&)}Don't ever let it turn you 'round
Dialogue: 2,0:22:32.99,0:22:35.13,OP,,0,0,0,fx,{\bord0\fad(150,150)}Don't ever let it turn you 'round
Dialogue: 1,0:22:35.13,0:22:38.77,OP,,0,0,0,fx,{\c&HFFFFFF&\fad(150,150)\t(3490,3640,\1a&HFF&)}It can't even blow all that hot air it's full of
Dialogue: 2,0:22:35.13,0:22:38.77,OP,,0,0,0,fx,{\bord0\fad(150,150)}It can't even blow all that hot air it's full of
